  "prompt": "Okay, let's build this shot. We’re aiming for a disorienting, unsettling feeling – 2008, a late-night drive. Begin with a slow, almost imperceptible pan across the windshield, the camera subtly adjusting as if reacting to headlights.  As the shot stabilizes, introduce a fleeting glimpse of a snow leopard darting across a darkened warehouse rooftop, immediately followed by a sleek black panther weaving through neon-lit city streets.  Maintain this rapid, jarring cut – a peacock strutting across an abandoned construction site, then a vibrant toucan perched on a billboard – each animal appearing and disappearing within a second or two.  Finally, the camera pulls back slightly, returning to the open road ahead, the windshield now reflecting only the blurred lights of the passing vehicles, leaving the viewer with a lingering sense of unease and the feeling that something was always just out of view."
}
